{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.substrate_consistency_window","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.substrate_consistency_window","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.substrate_consistency_window","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.substrate_consistency_window","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L40-L60","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe QOU framework has **one free parameter**: the substrate\nparameter $q$.  Every observable quantity --- masses, couplings,\ndecay rates, causal structure --- is a function of $q$ alone.\nThe parameter is **overdetermined**: independent classes of\nmeasurements each fix $q$ to a narrow range, and these ranges\noverlap.\n\nThe Lean encoding below derives the equality from the hypothesis class. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:substrate-consistency-window","label":"prop:substrate-consistency-window","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/substrate-consistency-window.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.q_hi_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.q_hi_def","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The upper bound is q* + epsilon k. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.q_lo_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.q_lo_def","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The lower bound is q* - epsilon k. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.epsilon_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.epsilon_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Half-width is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowConjecture","kind":"class","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L31-L38","doc":"The physical hypotheses carried by the Substrate Consistency Window Conjecture. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.epsilon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.epsilon","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Half-width of the measurement window for class `k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.q_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.q_star","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L27-L27","doc":"The unique substrate parameter `q*`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.q_hi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.q_hi","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Per-class upper bound `q_hi k` on `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.q_lo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.q_lo","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Per-class lower bound `q_lo k` on `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.n_classes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.n_classes","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/substrate_consistency_window.lean#L21-L21","doc":"Number of independent measurement classes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SubstrateConsistencyWindowContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":